# 构建与本地临时输出（build/、temp/、target/ 一律不入库）
/build/
/target/
/temp/
**/target/
**/build/

# Dart / Flutter 生成目录与本地缓存
**/.dart_tool/
**/.pub/
**/.pub-cache/
**/doc/api/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.last_build_id
app.*.symbols
app.*.map.json

# Flutter 平台工程内的构建产物与本地配置（工程本身由 AND-01/WIN-01 生成并入库）
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/release/
**/android/.cxx/
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id

# IDE / 编辑器
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
**/.vscode/

# 系统与临时文件
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.log

# contracts/、SADD/、tools/ 是受版本管理的契约与工具，不得忽略。
